    "segments": [
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-02.mp3",
        "text": "今日雞先生同An鴨想出市區玩。",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/02.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-03.mp3",
        "text": "雞先生問：「點樣搭車出去呀？」An鴨答：「唔知呀！」",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/03.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-04.mp3",
        "text": "雞先生話：「我哋可唔可以行路去呢？」",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/04.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-05.mp3",
        "text": "雖然唔使錢，但係太遠喇，佢哋行唔到！",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/05.mp3"
      }
    ],
    "reference": "两位朋友想去市区玩，还不清楚怎么乘车。其中一位提议步行，虽然不用花钱，但距离太远，走不到。",
    "facts": [
      {
        "id": "f1",
        "category": "main",
        "label": "理解这是一段商量外出交通方式的对话（不要求复述所有细节）",
        "weight": 40,
        "segment": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "f2",
        "category": "detail",
        "label": "目的地是市区",
        "weight": 10,
        "segment": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "f3",
        "category": "detail",
        "label": "还不知道怎么乘车",
        "weight": 10,
        "segment": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "f4",
        "category": "detail",
        "label": "有人提议走路",
        "weight": 10,
        "segment": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "f5",
        "category": "detail",
        "label": "走路不用花钱",
        "weight": 10,
        "segment": 3
      },
      {
        "id": "f6",
        "category": "logic",
        "label": "因为距离太远，所以无法步行过去",
        "weight": 20,
        "segment": 3
      }
    ]
