    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-06.mp3",
        "text": "An鴨話：「噉不如我哋搭地鐵吖！」",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/06.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-07.mp3",
        "text": "雖然地鐵可以去到好多地方，但係地鐵站閂咗，佢哋冇得搭呀！",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/07.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-08.mp3",
        "text": "雞先生話：「噉我哋可唔可以搭小巴呢？」",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/08.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-09.mp3",
        "text": "雖然小巴好快，但係好少位，要排好耐隊！",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/09.mp3"
      }
    ],
    "reference": "两位朋友先考虑乘地铁，但车站已经关闭，无法乘坐；接着考虑小巴，小巴虽然快，但座位少，需要排很久的队。",
    "facts": [
      {
        "id": "f1",
        "category": "main",
        "label": "理解这是一段考虑交通方式却遇到困难的对话（不要求复述所有细节）",
        "weight": 40,
