      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
    },
    "segments": [
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-10.mp3",
        "text": "An鴨話：「噉我哋可唔可以踩單車去呢？」",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/10.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-11.mp3",
        "text": "但係佢哋對腳太短喇，踩唔到單車。",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/11.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-12.mp3",
        "text": "最後佢哋發現，原來附近有巴士站呀！可以搭巴士去呀！",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/12.mp3"
      },
      {
        "audioUrl": "/listening-audio/hbl-00001-13.mp3",
        "text": "嘟咗八達通，坐好巴士，佢哋出街玩喇！",
        "originalAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/global-asp/hbl-audio/master/audio/yue/00001/mp3/13.mp3"
      }
    ],
    "reference": "两位朋友考虑骑自行车，但因为腿太短骑不了。后来发现附近有公交站，最后刷八达通乘公交车出去玩。",
    "facts": [
      {
